@startuml bridge_token_lifecycle_state
!include ../style.puml
!pragma layout smetana

title Bridge token lifecycle states\nbridge_tokens + mint / revoke / usage RPC

top to bottom direction

state "Not issued" as NotIssued
NotIssued : no bridge_tokens row
NotIssued : no plaintext at rest

state "Active" as Active {
  [*] --> NeverUsed
  state "Active / never used" as NeverUsed
  NeverUsed : revoked_at = null
  NeverUsed : expires_at > now (at auth)
  NeverUsed : first_used_at = null
  NeverUsed : ingest_count = 0
  NeverUsed : born-clean insert\n(no seeded usage / not pre-revoked)

  state "Active / used" as Used
  Used : revoked_at = null
  Used : expires_at > now (at auth)
  Used : first_used_at set
  Used : ingest_count >= 1

  NeverUsed --> Used : successful live insert\n[insertedCount > 0]\n/ bump_bridge_token_usage
}

state Expired #FFE0B2
Expired : revoked_at = null
Expired : expires_at <= now\n(computed in authenticateBearer)
Expired : 401 token_expired

state Revoked #FFCDD2
Revoked : revoked_at IS NOT NULL
Revoked : one-way (DB immutability guard)
Revoked : 401 token_revoked
Revoked : re-revoke → already_revoked

[*] --> NotIssued

NotIssued --> NeverUsed : mint-bridge-token\n[user JWT + liveSensors +\ntent owner]\n/ 32 bytes → vbt_…\n/ store SHA-256 + prefix\n/ return plaintext once

Active --> Expired : authenticateBearer\n[expires_at <= request now]\n(no scheduler required in model)
Active --> Revoked : revoke-bridge-token\n[owner JWT]\n/ UPDATE WHERE revoked_at IS NULL

Expired --> [*]
Revoked --> [*]

note right of Revoked
  **Forbidden:** Revoked → Active
  No edge drawn. Clearing revoked_at
  is blocked for client roles.
end note

note left of Expired
  Expiry evaluated at request clock
  unless a sweeper job is proven in source.
  (None required for this model.)
end note

note bottom of NeverUsed
  **Does not transition on:**
  • duplicate-only ingest (insertedCount = 0)
  • stale 200 accepted:false (no write)
  • entitlement 403 (token row unchanged)
end note

legend right
  |= State |= Predicate |
  | Not issued | no row |
  | Active / never used | valid; ingest_count = 0 |
  | Active / used | valid; ingest_count >= 1 |
  | Expired | expires_at <= now at auth |
  | Revoked | revoked_at set (terminal) |
endlegend

caption Implemented controls ≠ all runtime-proven.\nStrict DB harness may remain BLOCKED (zero-skip not yet green).

@enduml
